{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2TI","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"提摩太後書","commonName":"提摩太後書","title":"提摩太後書","order":55,"numberOfChapters":4,"sha256":"426bedd2562e38343ea8503f188873f48e1060b8bb245430e58ccc5475b1545c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2TI/1.json","lastChapterNumber":4,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2TI/4.json","totalNumberOfVerses":83},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["末世的人性"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["你該知道，末世必有危險的日子來到。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["因為那時，人要專顧自己，貪愛錢財，自誇，狂傲，謗讟，違背父母，忘恩負義，心不聖潔，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["無親情，不解怨，好說讒言，不能自約，性情凶暴，不愛良善，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["賣主賣友，任意妄為，自高自大，愛宴樂，不愛上帝，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["有敬虔的外貌，卻背了敬虔的實意；這等人你要躲開。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["那偷進人家、牢籠無知婦女的，正是這等人。這些婦女擔負罪惡，被各樣的私慾引誘，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["常常學習，終久不能明白真道。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["從前雅尼和佯庇怎樣敵擋摩西，這等人也怎樣敵擋真道。他們的心地壞了，在真道上是可廢棄的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["然而他們不能再這樣敵擋；因為他們的愚昧必在眾人面前顯露出來，像那二人一樣。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["對提摩太的最後指示"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["但你已經服從了我的教訓、品行、志向、信心、寬容、愛心、忍耐，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["以及我在安提阿、以哥念、路司得所遭遇的逼迫、苦難。我所忍受是何等的逼迫；但從這一切苦難中，主都把我救出來了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["不但如此，凡立志在基督耶穌裏敬虔度日的也都要受逼迫。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["只是作惡的和迷惑人的，必越久越惡，他欺哄人，也被人欺哄。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["但你所學習的，所確信的，要存在心裏；因為你知道是跟誰學的，"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["並且知道你是從小明白聖經，這聖經能使你因信基督耶穌，有得救的智慧。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["聖經都是上帝所默示的",{"noteId":1},"，於教訓、督責、使人歸正、教導人學義都是有益的，"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["叫屬上帝的人得以完全，預備行各樣的善事。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：凡上帝所默示的聖經","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":16}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2TI/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2TI/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2TI/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}